# script-ch21.rpyc:10
translate chinese ch21_main_0f077782:

    # m "Hi again, [player]!"
    m "又见面啦，[player]！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:11
translate chinese ch21_main_95ea4bac:

    # m "Glad to see you didn't run away on us. Hahaha!"
    m "真高兴你没有临阵脱逃。哈哈哈！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:12
translate chinese ch21_main_ecaf5654:

    # mc "Nah, don't worry."
    mc "没有啦，别担心。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:13
translate chinese ch21_main_a0e98f5a:

    # mc "This might be a little strange for me, but I at least keep my word."
    mc "这对我来说是有点不习惯，但好歹我说到做到。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:16
translate chinese ch21_main_5bff8fb6:

    # "Well, I'm back at the Literature Club."
    "就这样，我又来到了文学部。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:17
translate chinese ch21_main_0565e928:

    # "I was the last to come in, so everyone else is already hanging out."
    "我最后一个到，其他人都已经各自聚着聊天了。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:19
translate chinese ch21_main_209577b0:

    # y "Thanks for keeping your promise, [player]."
    y "谢谢你信守承诺，[player]。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:20
translate chinese ch21_main_0762f28d:

    # y 1a "I hope this isn't too overwhelming of a commitment for you."
    y 1a "希望这不会成为你太沉重的负担。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:21
translate chinese ch21_main_0b033aa0:

    # y 1u "Making you dive headfirst into literature when you're not accustomed to it..."
    y 1u "让你在还不习惯的情况下，一头扎进文学的世界……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:23
translate chinese ch21_main_4bc8df14:

    # n "Oh, come on! Like he deserves any slack."
    n "拜托！可别对他太宽容了。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:24
translate chinese ch21_main_f114fc18:

    # n 4e "You already had to be dragged here by Monika."
    n 4e "你可是被莫妮卡硬拽来的。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:25
translate chinese ch21_main_e6e52d65:

    # n "I don't know if you plan to just come here and hang out, or what..."
    n "你要是只打算来这儿混日子什么的……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:26
translate chinese ch21_main_8ef8abd3:

    # n "But if you don't take us seriously, then you won't see the end of it."
    n "但你要是不拿出认真的态度来，我可不轻饶你。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:28
translate chinese ch21_main_e8cad960:

    # m "Natsuki, you certainly have a big mouth for someone who keeps her manga collection in the clubroom."
    m "夏树，把自己收藏的漫画放在活动室里的人，说话倒是挺不客气的嘛。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:29
translate chinese ch21_main_28526ae4:

    # n 4o "M-M-M...!!"
    n 4o "漫、漫……！！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:32
translate chinese ch21_main_6ff88347:

    # "Natsuki finds herself stuck between saying \"Monika\" and \"Manga\"."
    "夏树卡在了“莫妮卡”和“漫画”之间，不知该先反驳哪个。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:34
translate chinese ch21_main_8e1ee84b:

    # n 1v "Manga is literature!!"
    n 1v "漫画也是文学！！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:37
translate chinese ch21_main_036357ba:

    # "Swiftly defeated, Natsuki plops back into her seat."
    "被迅速击败的夏树一屁股坐回了椅子上。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:39
translate chinese ch21_main_134f5bf0:

    # y "I'm sorry, [player]..."
    y "对不起，[player]……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:40
translate chinese ch21_main_13b672c8:

    # y "We'll make sure to put your comfort first, okay?"
    y "我们会把你的感受放在第一位的，好吗？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:42
translate chinese ch21_main_0f6b17e0:

    # "Yuri shoots Natsuki with a disappointed glance."
    "优里责备地瞪了夏树一眼。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:43
translate chinese ch21_main_98f2c2ea:

    # y 1a "Um, anyway..."
    y 1a "那、那个，总之……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:44
translate chinese ch21_main_1d2411ac:

    # y "Now that you're in the club and all..."
    y "既然你也入部了……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:45
translate chinese ch21_main_15cca953:

    # y "...Perhaps you might have interest in picking up a book to read?"
    y "……或许你会有兴趣找本书读读？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:46
translate chinese ch21_main_c14c584c:

    # mc "Well..."
    mc "这个……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:47
translate chinese ch21_main_89fd5cc7:

    # mc "I can't really say no either way."
    mc "我没什么理由拒绝。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:48
translate chinese ch21_main_7c680eca:

    # mc "Like you said, I'm in this club now."
    mc "正如你说的，我现在是部里的一员了。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:49
translate chinese ch21_main_47b42db1:

    # mc "So it only feels right for me to do something like that, if you ask."
    mc "既然你都开口了，做点这样的事也是应该的。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:50
translate chinese ch21_main_014522fc:

    # y 4b "W-Wait..."
    y 4b "等、等等……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:51
translate chinese ch21_main_4031f60f:

    # y "I didn't mean it like that!"
    y "我不是那个意思！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:52
translate chinese ch21_main_6559e79e:

    # y "Uu..."
    y "呜……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:53
translate chinese ch21_main_2add5b01:

    # y "If you don't really want to, then forget I said anything, I guess..."
    y "要是你不情愿的话，就当我什么都没说吧……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:54
translate chinese ch21_main_1bbe57dc:

    # mc "Ah--No, it's not that, Yuri."
    mc "啊——不是那样的，优里。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:55
translate chinese ch21_main_a3efbc9a:

    # mc "I want to try to be a part of this club."
    mc "我是真心想融入这个社团。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:56
translate chinese ch21_main_720ff8ea:

    # mc "So even if I don't read often, I'd be happy to pick up a book if you wanted me to."
    mc "所以就算我不常读书，只要你希望，我很乐意拿起一本。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:57
translate chinese ch21_main_d39c2555:

    # y 3t "A-Are you sure...?"
    y 3t "真、真的吗……？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:58
translate chinese ch21_main_6234a550:

    # y "I just felt like..."
    y "我只是觉得……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:59
translate chinese ch21_main_5cc899a6:

    # y 3u "...Well, as Vice President and all..."
    y 3u "……毕竟身为副部长……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:60
translate chinese ch21_main_400ef1e7:

    # y "...That I should help you get started on something you might like."
    y "……该帮你从一本你可能会喜欢的书入门。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:61
translate chinese ch21_main_5c6d9095:

    # "Yuri reaches into her bag and pulls out a book."
    "优里把手伸进书包，取出一本书。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:62
translate chinese ch21_main_bb6c4878:

    # y 1s "I didn't want you to feel left out..."
    y 1s "我不想让你觉得自己被冷落了……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:63
translate chinese ch21_main_1879c00c:

    # y "So I picked out a book that I thought you might enjoy."
    y "所以挑了一本我觉得你也许会喜欢的书。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:64
translate chinese ch21_main_c76bcbd9:

    # y "It's a short read, so it should keep your attention, even if you don't usually read."
    y "篇幅不长，就算你不常读书，也应该能读得进去。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:65
translate chinese ch21_main_1c1fa68f:

    # y "And we could, you know..."
    y "而且我们可以……你懂的……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:67
translate chinese ch21_main_262616a0:

    # y 4b "Discuss it...if you wanted..."
    y 4b "一起讨论……如果你愿意的话……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:68
translate chinese ch21_main_257a5a4c:

    # "Th-This is..."
    "这、这是……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:69
translate chinese ch21_main_dbd79240:

    # "How is this girl accidentally being so cute?"
    "这女孩怎么会无意间这么可爱？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:70
translate chinese ch21_main_067cb0c1:

    # "She even picked out a book she thinks I'll like, despite me not reading much..."
    "明明知道我不怎么读书，她还特意挑了一本觉得我会喜欢的……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:71
translate chinese ch21_main_063782d3:

    # mc "Yuri, thank you! I'll definitely read this!"
    mc "优里，谢谢你！我一定会读的！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:72
translate chinese ch21_main_a0d526be:

    # "I enthusiastically take the book."
    "我满怀热情地接过了书。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:74
translate chinese ch21_main_f6554ff6:

    # y "Phew..."
    y "呼……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:75
translate chinese ch21_main_3b5e8d6c:

    # y 2a "Well, you can read it at your own pace."
    y 2a "你可以按自己的节奏慢慢读。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:76
translate chinese ch21_main_17c99d12:

    # y "I look forward to hearing what you think."
    y "期待听听你的感想。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:82
translate chinese ch21_main_5d35cc1a:

    # "Now that everyone's settled in, I expected Monika to kick off some scheduled activities for the club."
    "待大家都落座后，我以为莫妮卡会宣布部活的既定安排。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:83
translate chinese ch21_main_be0f213d:

    # "But that doesn't seem to be the case."
    "但似乎并不是这样。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:84
translate chinese ch21_main_301982d1:

    # "Yuri's face is already buried in a book."
    "优里已经埋头读起了书。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:85
translate chinese ch21_main_b18fd321:

    # "I can't help but notice her intense expression, like she was waiting for this chance."
    "我不由得注意到她专注的神情，仿佛一直在等待这个机会。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:86
translate chinese ch21_main_6713a333:

    # "Meanwhile, Natsuki is rummaging around in the closet."
    "另一边，夏树正在柜子里翻找着什么。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:100
translate chinese ch21_end_d91458f0:

    # mc "Phew..."
    mc "呼……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:101
translate chinese ch21_end_1782371d:

    # "I guess that's everyone."
    "应该都分享完了吧。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:102
translate chinese ch21_end_58e4d71b:

    # "I glance around the room."
    "我环视了一圈活动室。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:103
translate chinese ch21_end_21f37dea:

    # "That was a little more stressful than I anticipated."
    "这可比我想象的还要累人一些。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:104
translate chinese ch21_end_5b12ad4c:

    # "It's as if everyone is judging me for my mediocre writing abilities..."
    "仿佛所有人都在审视我这平庸的文笔……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:105
translate chinese ch21_end_72e6b5de:

    # "Even if they're just being nice, there's no way my poems can stand up to theirs."
    "就算她们只是出于好心，我的诗也绝对比不过她们的。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:106
translate chinese ch21_end_3e6d2aa1:

    # "This is a literature club, after all."
    "这里毕竟是文学部啊。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:107
translate chinese ch21_end_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "我叹了口气。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:108
translate chinese ch21_end_e55af38e:

    # "I guess that's what I ended up getting myself into."
    "看来我就是自作自受吧。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:109
translate chinese ch21_end_ad956e20:

    # "Across the room, Monika is writing something in her notebook."
    "活动室另一头，莫妮卡正往笔记本上写着什么。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:110
translate chinese ch21_end_841184ee:

    # "My eyes land on Yuri and Natsuki."
    "我的目光落在了优里和夏树身上。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:113
translate chinese ch21_end_1705c9fe:

    # "They gingerly exchange sheets of paper, sharing their respective poems."
    "她们小心翼翼地交换纸页，分享着彼此的诗。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:115
translate chinese ch21_end_37b74d39:

    # "As they read in tandem, I watch each of their expressions change."
    "她们同时读着对方的诗，我在一旁观察着两人神情的变化。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:116
translate chinese ch21_end_f3def454:

    # "Natsuki's eyebrows furrow in frustration."
    "夏树的眉头不满地皱了起来。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:117
translate chinese ch21_end_1583e001:

    # "Meanwhile, Yuri smiles sadly."
    "而优里则露出了落寞的微笑。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:119
translate chinese ch21_end_36ce7fb5:

    # n 1q "{i}(What's with this language...?){/i}"
    n 1q "{i}（这用词也太……？）{/i}"

# script-ch21.rpyc:122
translate chinese ch21_end_5f1028e8:

    # y 2f "Eh?"
    y 2f "诶？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:123
translate chinese ch21_end_392e3f64:

    # y "Um...did you say something?"
    y "那个……你说什么了吗？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:126
translate chinese ch21_end_5a23a338:

    # n 2c "Oh, it's nothing."
    n 2c "哦，没什么。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:127
translate chinese ch21_end_73b87d84:

    # "Natsuki dismissively returns the poem to the desk with one hand."
    "夏树漫不经心地单手把诗放回桌上。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:128
translate chinese ch21_end_678d666c:

    # n "I guess you could say it's fancy."
    n "要我说的话，算是有格调吧。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:131
translate chinese ch21_end_ee8faee5:

    # y 2i "Ah-- Thanks..."
    y 2i "啊——谢谢……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:132
translate chinese ch21_end_1705b12d:

    # y "Yours is...cute..."
    y "你的诗……很可爱……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:135
translate chinese ch21_end_d53cb64f:

    # n 2h "Cute?"
    n 2h "可爱？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:136
translate chinese ch21_end_d7a2229c:

    # n 1h "Did you completely miss the symbolism or something?"
    n 1h "你是完全没看懂里面的象征意义吗？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:137
translate chinese ch21_end_a5b7430f:

    # n "It's clearly about the feeling of giving up."
    n "这明显写的是放弃的心情。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:138
translate chinese ch21_end_0db745ab:

    # n "How can that be cute?"
    n "那种东西哪里可爱了？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:141
translate chinese ch21_end_d42c351b:

    # y 3f "I-I know that!"
    y 3f "我、我知道啦！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:142
translate chinese ch21_end_b698ba3b:

    # y "I just meant..."
    y "我只是想说……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:143
translate chinese ch21_end_2c3a3a03:

    # y 3h "The language, I guess..."
    y 3h "是说它的文风……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:144
translate chinese ch21_end_678374ea:

    # y "I was trying to say something nice..."
    y "我想夸夸它的……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:147
translate chinese ch21_end_5adabccb:

    # n "Eh?"
    n "哈？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:148
translate chinese ch21_end_b10ead8d:

    # n 4w "You mean you have to try that hard to come up with something nice to say?"
    n 4w "你是说你得绞尽脑汁才能憋出一句好话？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:149
translate chinese ch21_end_f9cdd784:

    # n "Thanks, but it really didn't come out nice at all!"
    n "谢了，可这说出来根本一点都不好听！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:152
translate chinese ch21_end_64c0a3eb:

    # y 1i "Um..."
    y 1i "那个……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:153
translate chinese ch21_end_15db327d:

    # y "Well, I do have a couple suggestions..."
    y "我倒是有几点建议……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:156
translate chinese ch21_end_ebd6a743:

    # n 5x "Hmph."
    n 5x "哼。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:157
translate chinese ch21_end_a87c36dd:

    # n "If I was looking for suggestions, I would have asked someone who actually liked it."
    n "我要是想听建议，会去找真正欣赏它的人。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:158
translate chinese ch21_end_4466dbb0:

    # n "Which people {i}did{/i}, by the way."
    n "顺便说一句，欣赏的人{i}可多着呢{/i}。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:159
translate chinese ch21_end_321942a4:

    # n 5e "Monika liked it."
    n 5e "莫妮卡就很喜欢。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:160
translate chinese ch21_end_0ea3372f:

    # n "And [player] did, too!"
    n "还有[player]也是！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:161
translate chinese ch21_end_3afcd245:

    # n "So based on that, I'll gladly give you some suggestions of my own."
    n "所以礼尚往来，我也很乐意给你几点建议。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:162
translate chinese ch21_end_4fda8f5a:

    # n "First of all--"
    n "首先——"

# script-ch21.rpyc:165
translate chinese ch21_end_0b794b70:

    # y 2l "Excuse me..."
    y 2l "不好意思……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:166
translate chinese ch21_end_166ab7be:

    # y "I appreciate the offer, but I've spent a long time establishing my writing style."
    y "谢谢你的好意，但我花了很长时间才形成自己的文风。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:167
translate chinese ch21_end_0d2b663b:

    # y 2h "I don't expect it to change anytime soon, unless of course I come across something particularly inspiring."
    y 2h "我不觉得它会轻易改变，除非遇到特别能启发我的东西。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:168
translate chinese ch21_end_7cad6bf8:

    # y "Which I haven't yet."
    y "而目前为止，我还没有遇到过。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:171
translate chinese ch21_end_8487fc0c:

    # n 1o "Nn...!"
    n 1o "唔……！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:174
translate chinese ch21_end_f72b1c71:

    # y 1k "And [player] liked my poem too, you know."
    y 1k "而且[player]也很喜欢我的诗。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:175
translate chinese ch21_end_75dd3224:

    # y "He even told me he was impressed by it."
    y "他甚至亲口对我说，他被深深打动了。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:177
translate chinese ch21_end_a5061963:

    # "Natsuki suddenly stands up."
    "夏树突然站了起来。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:180
translate chinese ch21_end_2824bf93:

    # n 4y "Oh?"
    n 4y "哦——？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:181
translate chinese ch21_end_693f0dc5:

    # n "I didn't realize you were so invested in trying to impress our new member, Yuri."
    n "我还真没发现，你这么热切地想给我们的新成员留下好印象呢，优里。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:185
translate chinese ch21_end_b63049e5:

    # y 1n "E-Eh?!"
    y 1n "诶、诶？！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:186
translate chinese ch21_end_3df614f2:

    # y "That's not what I...!"
    y "我才没有那个意思……！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:187
translate chinese ch21_end_803d0e3c:

    # y 1o "Uu..."
    y 1o "呜……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:188
translate chinese ch21_end_acc94b27:

    # y "You...You're just..."
    y "你……你分明就是……"

# script-ch21.rpyc:189
translate chinese ch21_end_6a5c0c7b:

    # "Yuri stands up as well."
    "优里也站了起来。"

# script-ch21.rpyc:190
translate chinese ch21_end_fb24704f:

    # y 2r "Maybe you're just jealous that [player] appreciates my advice more than he appreciated yours!"
    y 2r "你该不会是嫉妒[player]更欣赏我的见解，而不是你的吧！"

# script-ch21.rpyc:193
translate chinese ch21_end_ee52e8e3:

    # n 1e "Huh! And how do you know he didn't appreciate {i}my{/i} advice more?"
    n 1e "哈！你怎么知道他不是更欣赏{i}我的{/i}见解？"

# script-ch21.rpyc:194
translate chinese ch21_end_6d2144a0:

